        <activityName xml:lang="en">Nuclear spent fuel conditioning plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Nuclear spent fuel conditioning plant
The assumed area and the volume of the building have been estimated from a preliminary aerial view. Concrete for shielding and weight of mashines are rough estimations. ;
UUID: 78a43b16-2526-37bd-a928-a9118057d41d
It includes land use, building, cranes and other mashines, concrete for shielding and its lining, transport of materials and mashines, and disposal of concrete for shielding. The disposal of the building is in the used module.
Location: Swiss conditions
Technology: Estimation of current technologies
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78a43b16-2526-37bd-a928-a9118057d41d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
